/- PM-FORMAL-GLOSS
This opening passage states the authors’ three aims and describes the expository
status of Chapter I. It is historical metatheoretical prose, not an axiom or a
Lean declaration. In particular, its claims about contradiction avoidance are
not treated as a proved consistency theorem.
